<TaxTool kind="overtime" heading="Overtime Pay Calculator" />
<article class="prose"><h2>How this estimate works</h2><p>Overtime pay is generally included in taxable wages. Your actual tax impact depends on annual income and withholding.</p><h2>What can change your result?</h2><p>Your filing status, total annual income, deductions, credits, other jobs, employer withholding method and state or local tax rules can change the final amount. The inputs on this page are intentionally simplified; they do not represent every IRS or state calculation rule.</p><h2>Related resources</h2><p>Explore more <a href="/tax-tools/">tax calculators</a>, compare <a href="/paycheck-calculators-by-state/">paycheck calculators by state</a>, or review our <a href="/methodology/">methodology and sources</a>.</p></article>
</BaseLayout>
